    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d387">

                <pb facs="0345" n="333" xml:id="pg333"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">701.9491/21: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in Iran</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Dreyfus</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to
                        the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Tehran</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1942-04-13T12:00:00+03:25">April 13,
                            1942—noon</date>.<lb/>[Received April 13—9:17 a.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>104. Referring to my 103, April 12, Prime Minister last evening informed Japanese
                    Minister that his Legation must depart from Iran within a week. Question of
                    means of exit now under discussion. Japanese wish to proceed to Turkey to which
                    Iranians have no objection. British however do not approve dumping of further
                    Axis diplomats in Turkey and are insisting that Legation return to Japan via
                    Russia.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Dreyfus</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
